{"seq":1,"slug":"sleep-architecture","title":"睡眠结构","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/sleep-science/sleep-architecture","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sleep-stages-and-cycles","title":"睡眠阶段与周期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/sleep-science/sleep-architecture/sleep-stages-and-cycles","wordCount":2082,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"nrem-deep-sleep-functions","title":"NREM 深度睡眠功能","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/sleep-science/sleep-architecture/nrem-deep-sleep-functions","wordCount":2519,"readingTime":11},{"seq":3,"slug":"rem-sleep-and-dreaming","title":"REM 睡眠与梦境","url":"/l-doc-books/h/health-medicine/sleep-science/sleep-architecture/rem-sleep-and-dreaming","wordCount":2681,"readingTime":11}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"睡眠结构\">睡眠结构</h1><p>本章探讨人类睡眠的内部架构——从宏观的睡眠周期到微观的脑电波特征。</p>\n<h2 id=\"内容概要\">内容概要</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>睡眠阶段与周期</strong>：一个完整的睡眠夜晚由 4-6 个约 90-110 分钟的周期组成，每个周期包含 NREM 和 REM 两大阶段</li>\n<li><strong>NREM 深度睡眠功能</strong>：N3 慢波睡眠是身体修复、生长激素分泌和陈述性记忆巩固的关键窗口</li>\n<li><strong>REM 睡眠与梦境</strong>：快速眼动睡眠负责情绪调节、程序性学习和类淋巴系统清除代谢废物</li>\n</ul>\n<p>理解睡眠结构是后续学习昼夜节律、健康影响和优化策略的基础。</p>\n"}